    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.statusline\n\n### Question\n\nCan I configure it so that the whole status line width is for only the focused/current buffer. Example, Currently in git difftool, i get very squeezed statusline.\r\n<img width=\"1357\" height=\"129\" alt=\"2026-03-02-203542\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ee03ffef-ad9c-494c-b274-43af547ff182\" />\r\n",
    "bodyHTML": "<h3 dir=\"auto\">Contributing guidelines</h3>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> I have read <a href=\"https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md\">CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Module(s)</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">mini.statusline</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Question</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Can I configure it so that the whole status line width is for only the focused/current buffer. Example, Currently in git difftool, i get very squeezed statusline.<br>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/47189744/557035386-ee03ffef-ad9c-494c-b274-43af547ff182.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..KKC4dFRoeIjo5z8dyREXyoSh4oUxOb0aPMgMgrci9Ds\"><img width=\"1357\" height=\"129\" alt=\"2026-03-02-203542\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/47189744/557035386-ee03ffef-ad9c-494c-b274-43af547ff182.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..KKC4dFRoeIjo5z8dyREXyoSh4oUxOb0aPMgMgrci9Ds\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 129px;; aspect-ratio: 1357 / 129; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px\" class=\"js-gh-image-fallback\"></a></p>",
    "bodyText": "Contributing guidelines\n\n I have read CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md\n\nModule(s)\nmini.statusline\nQuestion\nCan I configure it so that the whole status line width is for only the focused/current buffer. Example, Currently in git difftool, i get very squeezed statusline.",
    "category": {
        "createdAt": "2022-01-02T14:24:09Z",
        "description": "Ask the community for help",
        "emoji": ":pray:",
        "emojiHTML": "<div>🙏</div>",
        "id": "DIC_kwDOFoksYM4CAgqN",
        "isAnswerable": true,
